{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1148263-mage-fiction","id":1148263,"title":"Mage Fiction","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-09T03:43:57-07:00","id":1148263,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Mage Fiction","content":"can anyone reccomend any decent Mage: the awakening fiction? talking fan fiction, Actual Play, ideally free, short of money at the moment, but any official stuff as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-09T04:52:44-07:00","id":1148270,"title":"","content":"Well, let's see... there's the <a href=\"http://www.drivethrufiction.com/product/143174/The-Fallen-World-Chronicle-Anthology\" target=\"_blank\">Fallen World Anthology</a>, of course. Could've sworn there was at least one novel released that focused on the signature characters from 1E like Arctos and Morvran. The APs for DaveB's MtAw games deserve attention, too: <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?279847-Actual-Play-Mage-The-Awakening-The-Broken-Diamond-(contains-Reign-of-the-Exarchs\" target=\"_blank\">Broken Diamond</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?316806-Actual-Play-Mage-The-Awakening-Bleak-House\" target=\"_blank\">Bleak House</a> (one-shot), and <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?375715-Mage-The-Awakening-The-Soul-Cage\" target=\"_blank\">The Soul Cage</a>. <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?591295-Mage-the-Awakening-The-Man-Comes-Around\" target=\"_blank\">The Man Comes Around</a> is technically an incomplete AP, since Dave's been a little busy actually, y'know, <i>developing</i> 2E and all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":747,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","user":"Knowbody","date":".  added links 10-09-2017, 08:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-09T09:13:49-07:00","id":1148324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1148263-mage-fiction?p=1148270#post1148270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could've sworn there was at least one novel released that focused on the signature characters from 1E like Arctos and Morvran.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there was character background stuff released as publicity at launch, but there's no novel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"