ath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T14:17:28-07:00","id":1150006,"title":"","content":"Can someone link to DavidB's Actual plays? Thank y'all!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/19129-asteres","name":"asteres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T14:43:27-07:00","id":1150015,"title":"","content":"Sorry in no particular order:<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?316806-Actual-Play-Mage-The-Awakening-Bleak-House\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...ng-Bleak-House</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?375715-Mage-The-Awakening-The-Soul-Cage\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...-The-Soul-Cage</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?279847-Actual-Play-Mage-The-Awakening-The-Broken-Diamond-(contains-Reign-of-the-Exarchs\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...of-the-Exarchs</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?591295-Mage-the-Awakening-The-Man-Comes-Around\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php...n-Comes-Around</a><br /> <br /> they are all mage and set in a verity of places, not got round to reading them yet, so cant say which are set where","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T17:12:48-07:00","id":1150036,"title":"","content":"First one is set in Paris. It's a one shot. Second one is originally set in England. They do a touch of traveling. It's the &quot;second&quot; story among the three chronicle spanning stories. The third one is set in Washington D.C. It's the &quot;first&quot; story among the three chronicle spanning stories. The fourth one is the &quot;Third&quot; story among the three chronicle spanning stories. It's also the only one that isn't finished.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T09:58:26-07:00","id":1150386,"title":"","content":"Oh, I should mention Custody Battle too. Its one of the short stories from the Fallen World Anthology that DaveB generously spoilered in a dev blog. The link to the early draft version is at the bottom of this page. <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/redlines-and-anthologies-mage-the-awakening/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/redlines-and-...the-awakening/</a><br /> <br /> Might help you decide if picking up the anthology is worth your money. I know its on my to do list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}